script = ExtResource("1_fgsq1")
letter_text = "\"Dear Prime- Citizen #0842-JG,

CONGRATULATIONS!

We are thrilled to inform you that your current residence will be DECOMMISSIONED
in exactly [ONE] [DAYS] as part of the Greater Guelph Region's infrastructure improvement
initiative: [SUPER-HIGHWAY STRUCTURAL SUPPORT STRUT 741B]!

Your current residence will soon play a critical role in being demolished to make way]
for a 72-lane hyperloop, exclusively available to Prime+ citizens. Upgrade to Prime+
citizenship today to unlock the benefits of same-day hyperloop access, exclusive perks,
and priority housing upgrades!

You have been pre-selected for alternative accommodation in PRIME- GIGAPLEX 9,
AtlasCo’s flagship value housing megastructure. In addition to this, please accept this
voucher for one day's free occupancy fee! Your new accommodation awaits you:

Tower: Prime- Gigaplex 9
Floor: 87
Unit: 216

Welcome to the future of living!\""
text_start_delay = 0.35
chars_per_second = 22.5

